      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "叫做反比例函数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通常说，变量 $y$ 和变量 $x$ 成反比。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为式 $\\frac{k}{x}$ 对于任何不等于 0 的 $x$ 值都有意义，所以",
        "式 $y=\\frac{k}{x}$ 给出函数的定义域可以是不等于零的所有数的集",
        "合，也可以是它的一个子集。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由式 $y=\\frac{k}{x}$ 可以得出 $xy=k$。反过来，由 $xy=k\\ (k\\ne0)$，",
        "也可以得出 $y=\\frac{k}{x}$。因此，要判断函数 $x\\xrightarrow{f}y$ 是不是反比例函",
        "数，只要比较变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 各对对应值的积 $xy$ 是否相等就行",
        "了。如果这些积都等于同一个不等于 0 的数，那么这函数就",
        "是反比例函数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们再举两个例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1．下表给出的函数 $m\\xrightarrow{f}n$ 是反比例函数吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        139,
        1311,
        1098,
        174
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "tbl-p0082-01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求出变量 $m$ 和 $n$ 各对对应值的积 $mn$："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        137,
        1586,
        1100,
        250
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "tbl-p0082-02"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，所得的积都等于同一个数 15。所以函数 $f$ 是反",
        "比例函数。"
      ]
    },
